OL,3,GNEWSALocal heroes honoured at Make a
OL,4,ADifference awards
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople who make life better for others
OL,7,Fin their local communities have had
OL,8,Ftheir work honoured at this year's BBC
OL,9,FRadio Sheffield Make a Difference
OL,10,FAwards.
OL,12,FThe awards were set up during the Covid
OL,13,Fpandemic to recognise and celebrate
OL,14,Feveryday, unsung heroes, and this
OL,15,Fyear's winners included a
OL,16,FStrictly-loving guide dog, a fearsome
OL,17,Ffundraiser and a festive dinner lady.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
