OL,3,GNEWSALocal heroes honoured at Make a
OL,4,ADifference awards
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe award ceremony, now in its fifth
OL,7,Fyear, took place at at Barnsley Civic
OL,8,FTheatre and was hosted by BBC Radio
OL,9,FSheffield's Ellie Colton and Paulette
OL,10,FEdwards
OL,12,FBreakfast presenter Ellie said: "Our
OL,13,FMake a Difference Awards are such a
OL,14,Flovely opportunity to shine a light on
OL,15,Fso many incredible people and beautiful
OL,16,Fstories."
